== Overview ==
The '''Large Toilet''' is usually the [[toilet]] that appears before the [[Boss Toilet|boss toilet]]. It looks exactly like a [[Normal Toilet|normal toilet]] but bigger and has more health. It has a [[Normal Toilet|normal]] and [[Small Toilet|small]] variant. It usually gives around $100 upon death. 
