== Strategy ==
*The '''Large Toilet''' does have a lot of health, but is very slow. In other modes, it is spammed and can give you thousands of money.
*AoE units such as the [[Large TV Man]] can easily defeat groups of this enemy.
*In Hard mode+, this toilet comes in group making a great way for units that have AoE to destroy and make a lot of money(When killed 1 toilet gives 100$)
== Trivia ==

* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Large_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Large Skibidi Toilet] from the series.
* The Large Toilet has the same model as the [[Small Toilet]] and the [[Toilet]], just being larger than both.

